        "answer": {
          "short": "A smooth increasing curve through $(0,0)$, $(1,3)$, $(4,6)$, $(9,9)$ and $(16,12)$.",
          "worked": "Use $p$ on the horizontal axis and $q$ on the vertical axis. Plot $(0,0)$, $(1,3)$, $(4,6)$, $(9,9)$ and $(16,12)$, then draw a smooth curve through the points.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
